  "description": {
    "text": "One of the two half decks in the ADV Gift Box, a set for beginners released on 28 November 2003 with everything needed to play: two ready-built 30-card half decks, a coin, 30 damage counters, two markers, a playmat, a how-to-play book and a Pokémon Card Game CD-ROM that taught the rules on a computer. This deck is led by Latias ex, the other by Latios ex.",
    "sources": [
      {
        "title": "Pokémon Card Game official site, archived: ギフトボックス",
        "url": "https://web.archive.org/web/20090227020359/http://www.pokemon-card.com/products/adv/adv_13.html"
      },
      {
        "title": "Wikipedia (Japanese): ポケモンカードゲームの発売タイトル一覧",
